{#89D2E8}{#FFFF00}Help (aggdef){/}

{#FCA712}'aggdef' command{/}
    Find out where to set your aggdef slider to be 1/1
    {#FFFFFF}!aggdef <attack time> <recharge time> <init value>{/}

If you are lazy, just use
    {#FFFFFF}!weapon <drop weapon into chat>{/}

Example:
    Your weapon has an attack time of {#FFFFFF}1.2{/} seconds and a recharge time of {#FFFFFF}1.5{/} seconds.
    Your melee/ranged init is {#FFFFFF}1200{/}:
    {u}{#219CFF}/tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200{/}{/u}

{i}See {u}{#219CFF}!help syntax{/}{/u} for an explanation of the command syntax{/i}{/}
